00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:14.734
-Now, we do this thing
every week

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:15.901
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:17.734
and ask you guys to respond
to that topic.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.367
So, this week, our hashtag was

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:21.567
"#AddAWordRuinABook."

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.434
And I asked you to add one word

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:25.767
to a title of a famous book
and make it way worse.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.100
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.400
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:30.868
And now, I thought I'd share

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.734
some of my favorite responses
from you guys.

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.501
This first one is from
@IamTonyTequila.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:38.501
